{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐競選2026》今日進行首輪面試，相信大家已經睇了不少參賽者，其實當中已經浮現了一些大熱份子，其中一位叫Cecilia的佳麗，更是有齊背景非常厲害。</p><figure><img alt=\"Cecilia。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138441499638239232531482.jpeg/PqzgNm8wUN12WsOY-PJf6tVfoSiGwGJkDAGnqQwBp6k\"/><figcaption>Cecilia。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>香港小姐2026｜參選華姐奪三甲</p><p>Cecilia在上年年尾參賽多倫多華裔小姐，並最終奪得三甲位置，今次回港參賽港姐肯定是志在必得。翻查其社交平台相片，自少已經甜美可人，更有殺食大長腿，連倪晨曦都有follow佢，今屆一定要睇實！</p><figure><img alt=\"參選華姐奪三甲。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442848572936192709814.jpeg/nIRaENWSrPHuj5tbnalgjc1S_wwntnJEUafncFGn53A\"/><figcaption>參選華姐奪三甲。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"參選華姐奪三甲。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442841777770496871429.jpeg/zIb9ifkNO_uKcI_7I1P4SirZVs5njKbnCCTDUwgkw1M\"/><figcaption>參選華姐奪三甲。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cecilia有身材。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442851186118656920641.jpeg/FQ6dZrHQsno02uVbTVX7xiWCFLi5I0SFYLL8A2Cy_AM\"/><figcaption>Cecilia有身材。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cecilia有身材。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442848908480512542013.jpeg/9RA8s-GNENUpvBGyK5El5cUAS3TV9P1MkD5e35A-Xt8\"/><figcaption>Cecilia有身材。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大長腿。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442846484041728409862.jpeg/nFw6h_4Jiel-vljkA9XWNa9KHfpNNiZh3vgqGt74Kho\"/><figcaption>大長腿。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自少甜美可人。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442844147683328782493.jpeg/9XPc1De42PhMT8kLc1nQNgc-4mptWeWdpPqVEKT6lRA\"/><figcaption>自少甜美可人。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自少甜美可人。（IG相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442841932959744126430.jpeg/BeCGq60cWGW3MUZgDWxrctzgsHCaS1XvLdc7KC3XOyg\"/><figcaption>自少甜美可人。（IG相片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T03:39:50.635721+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}